<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 400" role="img">
  <title>A tokenizer trained on English costs 0.68 tokens per character for English and 2.85 for Hindi; after seeing Hindi, the greeting takes 3 tokens, not 37</title>
  <desc>Four horizontal bars of tokens per character: English 0.68 (26 tokens for 38 characters), Hindi 2.85 (37 for 13), emoji 4.00 (12 for 3) and mixed 1.20 (18 for 15), with a dashed guide at the English length. Below, two bars for the 13-character Hindi greeting: 37 tokens before and 3 tokens after the tokenizer was trained on Hindi too.</desc>
  <text x="400" y="44" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="24" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle">What the same tokenizer charges per character</text>
  <text x="20" y="84" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">tokens per character (tokenizer trained on English)</text>
  <text x="110" y="112" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">English</text>
  <rect x="120" y="100" width="68" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="196" y="112" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">0.68   (26 tokens / 38 characters)</text>
  <text x="110" y="152" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">Hindi</text>
  <rect x="120" y="140" width="285" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="413" y="152" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">2.85   (37 tokens / 13 characters)</text>
  <text x="110" y="192" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">emoji</text>
  <rect x="120" y="180" width="400" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="528" y="192" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">4.00   (12 tokens / 3 characters)</text>
  <text x="110" y="232" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">mixed</text>
  <rect x="120" y="220" width="120" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="248" y="232" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">1.20   (18 tokens / 15 characters)</text>
  <line x1="188" y1="96" x2="188" y2="262" stroke="#C7CDD4" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <text x="188" y="276" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="middle">English: 0.68</text>
  <line x1="120" y1="96" x2="120" y2="262" stroke="#14202B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <text x="20" y="304" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">the Hindi greeting, 13 characters, in tokens</text>
  <text x="110" y="328" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">before</text>
  <rect x="120" y="319" width="296" height="18" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="424" y="328" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">37 tokens</text>
  <text x="110" y="354" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central">after</text>
  <rect x="120" y="345" width="24" height="18" rx="4" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="152" y="354" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">3 tokens, once the tokenizer had been shown Hindi</text>
  <text x="400" y="376" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="middle">The vocabulary is whatever the tokenizer was trained on.</text>
</svg>
